[2025-04-14 21:29:23,955][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    AkiraBot has spammed 80,000+ websites since September 2024. It uses AI to create personalized messages that mention specific website content, helping bypass spam filters. The framework employs advanced CAPTCHA-bypassing techniques and rotates IP addresses to avoid detection.[\n]"
