[2025-04-14 21:29:23,960][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    The 2025 UK Cyber Security Breaches Survey shows 43% of businesses experienced cyber attacks. Phishing was the most common attack pattern while ransomware attacks doubled. Despite improved cybersecurity measures among small businesses, board-level responsibility has declined, creating gaps as threats continue to evolve.[\n]"
