[2025-04-14 21:29:24,052][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;li&gt;Easily protect Azure logins with strong forms of MFA.&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,052][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;li&gt;Keep access management streamlines so that the MFA mandate doesn&apos;t frustrate end users and admins alike.&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,052][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;li&gt;Go beyond traditional MFA and build a robust identity security program that includes Identity Security Posture Management (ISPM) and Identity Threat Detection and Response (ITDR).&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
