[2025-04-14 21:29:24,138][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    The State Bar of Texas suffered a data breach perpetrated by the INC ransomware gang. The threat actors stole full names, case documents, and other redacted information. The State Bar of Texas is offering free credit monitoring to victims and recommends that victims consider placing credit freezes.[\n]"
