[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Ftechcrunch.com%2F2025%2F04%2F03%2Fthis-sneaky-android-spyware-needs-a-password-to-uninstall-heres-how-to-remove-it-without-one%2F%3Futm_source=tldrinfosec/1/01000196158b09ac-50d6aa66-1152-4ca1-beeb-d089e8ac3dba-000000/dpM6yCwnkNVT58xXPalp4z5MaBvWwjzIP58ErCgVqg8=400&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    &lt;span&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                        &lt;strong&gt;This Sneaky Android Spyware Needs a Password to Uninstall. Here&apos;s How to Remove it Without One (6 minute read)&lt;/strong&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    &lt;/span&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;br&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;br&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Techcrunch has identified a new stalkerware app that requires a password to uninstall it. The app works by requiring the person who installs it to enable a built-in Android feature that allows for overlaying content, which allows the app to display the password prompt, which requires a password set by the person who installs it to dismiss whenever the user tries to uninstall it. Users can uninstall the app without a password by booting into safe mode. The app masquerades in the installed app list as a default Android app and also installs a device admin profile.[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,140][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                &lt;/span&gt;[\n]"
