[2025-04-14 21:29:24,158][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    China&apos;s National Internet censor just announced new rules requiring all AI-generated content to include clearly visible or audible watermarks to indicate that it is AI-generated. Users can omit the label in some circumstances, but the AI generator must warn users of the requirement and log any requests to ignore it. These regulations will go into effect on September 1.[\n]"
