[2025-04-14 21:29:24,168][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    SaaS breaches surged 300% last year, with attackers breaching core systems in as little as 9 minutes. The 2025 SaaS Security Threat Report by &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.obsidiansecurity.com%2Fdemo%2F%3Futm_source=tldr%26utm_medium=cpc%26utm_campaign=threatreport25demo%26utm_term=newsletter6/1/0100019600ef07dd-139c0546-c793-4407-9f39-78aa65e6e84f-000000/j2XYIWPB3dS-YZ_yfHL12X8f0Q2PqhjZxQvmB_FcD7g=399&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Obsidian Security&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; draws from the largest SaaS breach data repository and direct involvement in +150 incidents, revealing important past trends - and what to watch out for in the future. &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.obsidiansecurity.com%2Fsaas-security-threat-report%3Futm_source=tldr%26utm_medium=cpc%26utm_campaign=threatreport25%26utm_term=newsletter6/2/0100019600ef07dd-139c0546-c793-4407-9f39-78aa65e6e84f-000000/vv2VDm4ble5iyE_2hvx_Z7qJn-bh0vjZXvMemidAvjU=399&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Read the report&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
