[2025-04-14 21:29:24,178][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    A security flaw in Canon printer drivers, CVE-2025-1268, may allow hackers to run harmful code, compromising printing operations. This vulnerability affects specific Canon driver versions, enabling attackers to execute malicious code without user interaction. Canon is releasing patches, and users are urged to update their drivers promptly to mitigate exploitation risks.[\n]"
