[2025-04-14 21:29:24,179][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    File transfer software CrushFTP has warned users of a critical vulnerability that could lead to unauthorized access. Following a detailed write up by Project Discovery that included proof-of-concept exploit code, CISA and others are reporting that the vulnerability is being actively exploited. CrushFTP recommends enabling the DMZ zone feature if administrators cannot update the software right away.[\n]"
