[2025-04-14 21:29:24,227][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Google Workspace simplifies sending end-to-end encrypted emails in Gmail, enhancing data privacy and security. Client Side Encryption (CSE) supersedes S/MIME, encrypting data on the client before transmission or storage in Google&apos;s cloud, making it indecipherable to Google and third parties while complying with regulatory requirements like data sovereignty and HIPAA.[\n]"
