[2025-04-14 21:29:24,236][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    The BDSM People, CHICA, TRANSLOVE, PINK, and BRISH apps published publicly accessible secrets together with the apps&apos; code. The secrets included API keys that granted access to Google Cloud Storage buckets that contained nearly 1.5M user-uploaded photos, including public photos, private photos sent through direct messages, and photos removed for rules violations. M.A.D Mobile Apps Developers Limited, which publishes all of the apps, has not commented on the leak.[\n]"
