[2025-04-14 21:29:24,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Use Linux Landlock to run any Linux process in a secure, unprivileged sandbox. This tool is like firejail, but lightweight, user-friendly, and"
