[2025-04-14 21:29:24,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Browser-native ransomware could target data stored in browsers, bypassing traditional security measures. This type of ransomware is hard to detect and can lead to severe consequences, such as compromising email services and stealing sensitive company files.[\n]"
