[2025-04-14 21:29:24,253][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TLDR Information Security &lt;span id=&quot;date&quot;&gt;2025-03-28&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:24,253][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
