[2025-04-14 21:29:25,128][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA released two Industrial Control Systems (ICS) advisories on April 1, 2025. These advisories provide timely information about current security issues, vulnerabilities, and exploits surrounding ICS.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,128][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,128][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-091-01 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-091-01&quot;&gt;Rockwell Automation Lifecycle Services with Veeam Backup and Replication&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,128][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-24-331-04 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-24-331-04&quot;&gt;Hitachi Energy MicroSCADA Pro/X SYS600 (Update A)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,128][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,128][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA encourages users and administrators to review newly released ICS advisories for technical details and mitigations.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
