[2025-04-14 21:29:25,142][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "}[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,142][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/style&gt;[\n]"
