[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;A popular third-party GitHub Action, tj-actions/changed-files (tracked as &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2025-30066&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2025-30066&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;CVE-2025-30066&lt;/a&gt;), was compromised. This GitHub Action is designed to detect which files have changed in a pull request or commit. The supply chain compromise allows for information disclosure of secrets including, but not limited to, valid access keys, GitHub Personal Access Tokens (PATs), npm tokens, and private RSA keys. This has been patched in v46.0.1.[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA added CVE-2025-30066 to its &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&lt;/a&gt;.[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA strongly urges users to implement the recommendations to mitigate this compromise and strengthen security when using third-party actions.[0xc2][0xa0][0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,247][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;See the following resources for more guidance:[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;GitHub: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;tj-actions changed-files through 45.0.7 allows remote attackers to discover secrets by reading actions logs&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;tj-actions changed-files through 45.0.7 allows remote attackers to discover secrets by reading actions logs&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0][0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;GitHub: &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/security-guides/security-hardening-for-github-actions#using-third-party-actions&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Security hardening&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Security hardening for GitHub Actions - GitHub Docs&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,248][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;GitHub: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/tj-actions/changed-files?tab=readme-ov-file#changed-files&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;changed-files&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;tj-actions/changed-files: :octocat: Github action to retrieve all (added, copied, modified, deleted, renamed, type changed, unmerged, unknown) files and directories&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,249][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,249][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
