[2025-04-14 21:29:25,249][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This alert is provided [0xe2][0x80][0x9c]as is[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] for informational purposes only. CISA does not provide any warranties of any kind regarding any information within. CISA does not endorse any commercial product, entity, or service referenced in this alert or otherwise.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
