[2025-04-14 21:29:25,254][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA released seven Industrial Control Systems (ICS) advisories on March 18, 2025. These advisories provide timely information about current security issues, vulnerabilities, and exploits surrounding ICS.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
