[2025-04-14 21:29:25,277][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "0;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,277][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA has added five new vulnerabilities to its &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; title=&quot;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&quot;&gt;Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog&lt;/a&gt;, based on evidence of active exploitation.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
