[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "4/05152023-gov-delivery-banner-copy_original.png&quot; alt=&quot;Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency (CISA)&quot; title=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;100&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "  &lt;p&gt;You are subscribed to Cybersecurity Advisories for Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency. This information has recently been updated and is now available.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_item&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 2em;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_title&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: bold; font-size: 120%; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/alerts/2025/02/19/cisa-and-partners-release-advisory-ghost-cring-ransomware&quot;&gt;CISA and Partners Release Advisory on Ghost (Cring) Ransomware&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_pub_date&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 90%; font-style: italic; color: #666666; margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;02/19/2025 02:00 PM EST&lt;/div&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;div class=&quot;rss_description&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 0 0.3em; padding: 0;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;Today, CISA[0xe2][0x80][0x94]in partnership with the Federal Bureau of Investigation (FBI) and Multi-State Information Sharing and Analysis Center (MS-ISAC)[0xe2][0x80][0x94]released a joint Cybersecurity Advisory, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/cybersecurity-advisories/aa25-050a&quot; title=&quot;#StopRansomware: Ghost (Cring) Ransomware&quot;&gt;#StopRansomware: Ghost (Cring) Ransomware&lt;/a&gt;. This advisory provides network defenders with indicators of compromise (IOCs), tactics, techniques, and procedures (TTPs), and detection methods associated with Ghost ransomware activity identified through FBI investigations.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;Ghost actors conduct these widespread attacks targeting and compromising organizations with outdated versions of software and firmware on their internet facing services. These malicious ransomware actors are known to use publicly available code to exploit Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs) where available patches have not been applied to gain access to internet facing servers. The known CVEs are[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2018-13379&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2018-13379&quot;&gt;CVE-2018-13379&lt;/a&gt;,[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2010-2861&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2010-2861&quot;&gt;CVE-2010-2861&lt;/a&gt;,[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2009-3960&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2009-3960&quot;&gt;CVE-2009-3960&lt;/a&gt;,[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2021-34473&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2021-34473&quot;&gt;CVE-2021-34473&lt;/a&gt;,[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2021-34523&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2021-34523&quot;&gt;CVE-2021-34523&lt;/a&gt;,[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2021-31207&quot; title=&quot;CVE-2021-31207&quot;&gt;CVE-2021-31207&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA encourages network defenders to review this advisory and apply the recommended mitigations. See[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/stopransomware&quot; title=&quot;#StopRansomware&quot;&gt;#StopRansomware&lt;/a&gt; and the[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/stopransomware/ransomware-guide&quot; title=&quot;#StopRansomware Guide&quot;&gt;#StopRansomware Guide&lt;/a&gt; for additional guidance on ransomware protection, detection, and response. Visit CISA[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/cross-sector-cybersecurity-performance-goals&quot; title=&quot;Cross-Sector Cybersecurity Performance Goals&quot;&gt;Cross-Sector Cybersecurity Performance Goals&lt;/a&gt; for more information on the CPGs, including added recommended baseline protections.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-14 21:29:25,345][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This product is provided subject to this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/notification&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Notification&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Notification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]and this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Website Privacy Policy&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; Use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
