Attestations bind some subject (a named artifact along with its digest) to a SLSA build provenance predicate using the in-toto format. A verifiable signature is generated for the attestation using a short-lived Sigstore-issued signing certificate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.-QQnKmN9995ElcpR565Sh4FDbDl8l2C-PPzmEOTlS2IN-3J5NBa9BhH52AnZxyqEQtPOEVFTvpoKEwMHZE6rg0SzGFxpcwyfhHke9jYDDx8KmC3KJlBs2cOFPu14PSuubfEMYDES3Br_D0_roeK6t75CepLIi2K8DK__jSY6Xf_8cuHIKCq9k85-kV05U1N_jBjYV7H06OJA_164CIj5ebmtfS9fMDMUuKs7ikWLUxZQTvY1rC2oACTgH08gYSQD93MefEGDSRnrdVmeKLzCNFrhdwq0Z8UALUU-q2zvAHnvHbQfnJqcPbT54aEfFxtEySg6BVwYXYSMY57dWvfJhhwoMfFme7D0Pz09oOED9BX4pfMvRbYbMwEDr7AXA7NJcltuZKaX4mU9xlyUrMILM1KtZueninrx2kKYTZPl5lgE5M3d45q5dK_mfQga7SgJ/4fc/MMI6n3VFSkOR4zVEmIUHhw/h18/h001.Mo5d9xYX3UoKYyZNRHJ91UdQie23Ykf3ztBzlK-worY&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;CodeQLEAKED - Public Secrets Exposure Leads to Supply Chain Attack on GitHub CodeQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Praetorian[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.-QQnKmN9995ElcpR565Sh-SDvgyu6m58HhCZ9db8DGJ1Sx58A6mehlrZ1znb__pBkbCLOTYoftHK5Fm7y3h3T9iX_fm41AriTRP_n_QJvs04PoWjD07NjzxVsDto2L9K9g8yexB3VH0Fp1ZWA0GMAG__naJhcbBLF4yZBUjAdKRCdbgP3WwfjYzZXBpPYqKJx4xpzMMnaxq_r25N61o92bh_WtPtonTLXX_wMZ8dFP76zXSWcDSiAYlMXODkuNE3UsyhMFSd