t;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt; I hope you[0xe2][0x80][0x99]ve been doing well! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;table role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=&quot;transparent&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent;padding:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;table role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;color:#2A2A2A;font-weight:normal;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;color:#2A2A2A;font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;[0xf0][0x9f][0x8e][0x96][0xef][0xb8][0x8f]&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt; Working on Your Personality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align=&quot;center&quot; valign=&quot;top&quot; style=&quot;font-size:0px;line-height:0px;padding:5px 0px;&quot; class=&quot;dd&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;j&quot; role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;96%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;One family ritual I enjoy is having group FaceTime calls. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;We do the normal stuff, like catching up on each other[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s lives, wishing each other happy birthday, and having my siblings and I alternate doing push-ups while the others count out loud.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Two recent funny things stood out that I wanted to share.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;First, I forget how we got on this subject, but my mom said something like, [0xe2][0x80][0x9c][0xe2][0x80][0xa6]you[0xe2][0x80][0x99]ve got this going well, you[0xe2][0x80][0x99]ve got that going well[0xe2][0x80][0xa6] I guess you[0xe2][0x80][0x99]ve just got to work on your personality.[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] &lt;/span&gt;[0xf0][0x9f][0x98][0x82]&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;So now [0xe2][0x80][0x9c]You[0xe2][0x80][0x99]ve just gotta work on your personality[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] is our collective go-to advice whenever one of us is struggling with something.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Second, my sister has taken to calling her boyfriend [0xe2][0x80][0x9c]bro,[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] which is[0xe2][0x80][0xa6] awkwardly close to [0xe2][0x80][0x9c]brother,[0xe2][0x80][0x9d] especially when we[0xe2][0x80][0x99]re both on the call. &l