ded secrets, including the Firebase admin key, which would have allowed them to update any app, enabling them to push malicious updates to millions of users.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt; [0xf0][0x9f][0x92][0xa1]&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt; Shout-out to the Cursor team for paying $50K for a vulnerability not even directly in their software &lt;/span&gt;[0xf0][0x9f][0x91][0x8f]&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.-QQnKmN9995ElcpR565Sh3s51j8yJDzcKXmjvRKIsua3xurDUVqch63n65pjjeD68skrKoTAGj84YIqJeEY85IDnV6eGKS2saj0RLn2t4xmxrksgaGpxB5ys7zXF5uSLROhK-NVyi0PkxgBTG0QuNbYeVkORO846E1tcYjpemStzYvadsaCl4JrjLzCB6uXR8bszhJaW20EVEQlbUKSO1bIVeEqx8JpH0suW6bof5kVpTLEGIl9M2kTrhbXESHUdMp3rJB0c851unA5Xo6cNn1SLO70_rcKjXUmL-ejjS4ZChqeT00RapzXjwrMofk4gK6MT2OSjKxTeHcUpS0-XXw/4er/A_O0QUTdQvKpB6LLxIdwkg/h11/h001.EyKd_JpCO3nNPK3R2uVydqgoqfSgCtbsdiYPVmlFuZs&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Turning the Security Flywheel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Google Cloud CISO &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.-QQnKmN9995ElcpR565Sh-SDvgyu6m58HhCZ9db8DGKaFJKO5lI10zT95iBX