yn6ZS5YfcIWqGkNjV2vpxvx28hM11NJ6lztb_2ENV5_TnXzGOHJ7Vil24fOI5gaOUcut8q4bsQBoAEMlqQ9k-6qh5iyjbi3ntrSDmMAgexw-uS3x3XXsNYgevVI1zoztqR4rAIJQnRulpx22pZaoily0Ei4V_UeOnJlAUXFHm7hHd7c3m8611TRGX-LBNgTwUVla8TFWrjAgKcU3iEIuS09ICsjr8aoPJZTNsV1GjnaW5TDpscbcyKDW1nkipd6saGScX6o0iSyYpxv8g/4er/A_O0QUTdQvKpB6LLxIdwkg/h36/h001.tAssOiHsfCDL4r2vzq74MccvkWTvMyxt6S4T6AxJmbo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;matdoesdev&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt; and friends: An attempt at archiving every website seizure banner image or page created by government agencies. The database is updated partially automatically by periodically downloading CZDS and checking for domains with certain nameservers, and by scraping for news articles that mention website seizures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.m5CTo68rhNghfieTCcZktuvFQi5UTn7bxTzZvqqphERSP4NviRUZTi574YaCfQQk1Vf2z46jK6u1yIRzgWwZ09sc2wjqoGNELqUWT4tuVDoiYLEk13QnbLlD1hX-THyD5h8GWUcxmrMcV4pxT6Q-EDLWgAfowIo_2Vses3DYO_7vBkwwngL5KgbAh1WJzX3-JTZga_ObSTMNdjhFpITSw3-CfrPPWqLNGdANaCKTn_sJt98GqECxn8WemaxC-reDEhYumTncYesFh327iN5LmhDczYjS3o9UfZ7OeBorWznQmf0py6Jkfe_OobXRnO66/4er/A_O0QUTdQvKpB6LLxIdwkg/h37/h001.J88AxBlL6Iysn83dGgGsfEJfFV4wISQwo0wxiNlXGDY&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;S3N4T0R-0X0/APT-Attack-Simulation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;By &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.-QQnKmN9995ElcpR565Sh-SDvgyu6m58HhCZ9db8DGIl3zYgVitLirbXAyYGr1ASZhMULVB8aTQ33_QaGDOrnUB8LTQTgOHXDm6N3USwbIx0Y6suCOl-AGHmP-m2qjv2c_-y43pGB1Twxgn1wgQIVaDdP07gRcwO2Mykes3TT_YzprmrtvQGXUjs02f-VczWZ6pEWULOY77LbDMxJlVFzWfsbkevWNPG8MQvCIhms1KQRixABPIXuDvft6DFimVzHJ5-nTYZIIbq9whaD1QCFPN2IFbBHJI7vlRefiOLhtU/4er/A_O0QUTdQvKpB6LLxIdwkg/h38/h001.z5SXELkjUBaiZT_74agVVWJDhtprBDx57iW7narI57M&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Abdulrehman Ali&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;: A compilation of APT simulations (Russia, China, Iran, North Korea) that target many vital sectors, both private and governmental, including written tools, C2 servers, backdoors, exploitation techniques, stagers, bootloaders, and many other tools that attackers might have used in actual attacks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://link.mail.beehiiv.com/ss/c/u001.-QQnKmN9995ElcpR565Sh4f9Ug8JPnzgxr_QDSs5z-feD51RisVE3j4u9wMKt3-ncB8LL4lz8kvqFJOHxFmRVqu7j9O2s-rYxBxwNChE1W9emVRJ7Cji6vV02_OqlXoa0it-FrlG6wxU8-p8gh7DwpJa5A82D0PlRwakFaHHuA6eVIBfNBoSxJ5eiCVFsxRhu0j7qEODKbUGkc6zpZjuVFuCoIkNMj-pAc5wPHTgJdnsGHQ882BerCCg2fBCDr353hAfC3DsUWirUwuZPRkF8kqLx08ioM5C3fU7amXxf-YQYYmAH7RjgenbV398L3Hk3jmKRsxPLjqbRyTgKE2VGskKZXINOkds3oP4JlFjrtIP0Wn-m7uRmH1it9xHCYW5/4er/A_O0QUTdQvKpB6LLxIdwkg/h39/h001.fbQR6a7UIm8-ucHaeqlcAL-3lo4SCx2ryT3iO2dr1Hk&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Update: Stopping Cybercriminals from Abusing Cobalt Strike&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fortra, in collaboration with Microsoft&amp;#39;s Digital Crimes Unit and Health-ISAC describe their two-year effort to combat unauthorized use of Cobalt Strike and compromised Microsoft software for ransomware attacks. Their efforts have reduced unauthorized Cobalt Strike copies by 80%, seized over 200 malicious domains, and the average dwell time[0xe2][0x80][0x94]the period between initial detection and takedown[0xe2][0x80][0x94]has been reduced to less than one week in the United States and less than two weeks worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt; [0xf0][0x9f][0x92][0xa1]&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt; It[0xe2][0x80][0x99]s nice to see a company taking ownership for the impact their product can have, and taking real steps to stop bad actors from abusing it. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding:0px 15px;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height:24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;table role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td bgcolor=&quot;transparent&quot; style=&quot;background-color:transparent;padding:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;table role=&quot;none&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; cellpadding=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;dd&quot; align=&quot